1
00:00:09,051 --> 00:00:11,928
<i>This is bad.
It's already been two minutes.</i>

2
00:00:11,929 --> 00:00:13,430
<i>I can't wait any longer!</i>

3
00:00:13,889 --> 00:00:15,474
Sophia, Thunder Arm!

4
00:00:15,974 --> 00:00:16,892
Roger.

5
00:00:22,272 --> 00:00:24,566
<i>If I send a weak electric
shock current through the swamp,</i>

6
00:00:24,608 --> 00:00:26,485
<i>it should get him out of the water.</i>

7
00:00:26,944 --> 00:00:28,362
<i>But the problem is
Keisuke's father.</i>

8
00:00:29,071 --> 00:00:30,948
<i>He looked pretty weak already...</i>

9
00:00:31,031 --> 00:00:33,242
<i>Can his body withstand the current?</i>

10
00:00:35,035 --> 00:00:35,910
<i>What should I do?</i>

11
00:00:35,911 --> 00:00:39,248
<i>Is this decision...
...really the right one?!</i>

12
00:00:39,915 --> 00:00:42,167
<i>She's stubborn.</i>

13
00:00:42,209 --> 00:00:44,545
<i>Just give up and leave,
you dumb chicken!</i>

14
00:00:46,880 --> 00:00:48,131
<i>There's no time to hesitate!</i>

15
00:00:48,632 --> 00:00:50,884
<i>If I do nothing,
he'll die for sure!</i>

16
00:00:51,301 --> 00:00:52,302
<i>I'll roll the dice!</i>

17
00:00:56,306 --> 00:00:57,307
Now!

18
00:00:58,392 --> 00:00:59,434
All right!

19
00:01:04,523 --> 00:01:06,191
Not good, he's not breathing!

20
00:01:06,441 --> 00:01:08,652
Don't you die on me!

21
00:01:08,735 --> 00:01:11,989
Please, Keisuke's father!
Don't die!

22
00:01:12,406 --> 00:01:15,909
Keisuke's waiting for you!
Please! Come back!

23
00:01:16,368 --> 00:01:19,288
Please! Keisuke's father! Please!

24
00:01:26,169 --> 00:01:29,381
<i>I knew Brother possessed
the Righteous Egg.</i>

25
00:01:30,132 --> 00:01:32,175
<i>The destructive force behind
his attacks...</i>

26
00:01:32,676 --> 00:01:34,636
<i>I knew it had to be the Egg.</i>

27
00:01:35,304 --> 00:01:38,181
<i>Does that mean
this is a Second Awakening?</i>

28
00:01:39,099 --> 00:01:41,685
<i>But it's so different from
when it happened to me...</i>

29
00:01:42,102 --> 00:01:43,895
<i>That deep red aura...</i>

30
00:01:44,021 --> 00:01:45,772
<i>I sense a powerful darkness in it.</i>

31
00:01:46,773 --> 00:01:47,691
<i>Big Brother...</i>

32
00:01:48,233 --> 00:01:50,944
<i>Don't use
the Righteous Egg's power!</i>

33
00:01:51,028 --> 00:01:53,780
<i>I'm afraid once you do...
you'll be changed forever!</i>

34
00:01:57,284 --> 00:01:59,536
Now that's a good child.

35
00:01:59,786 --> 00:02:01,496
This is what I've been waiting for...

36
00:02:02,164 --> 00:02:04,166
The Awakening of Ruin.

37
00:02:04,499 --> 00:02:07,044
Now, show me...

38
00:02:07,836 --> 00:02:10,380
the evil power that lies within.

39
00:02:11,256 --> 00:02:14,759
I have to say,
you seem different than earlier.

40
00:02:14,760 --> 00:02:16,762
But you're still just
a Goshikidori.

41
00:02:16,845 --> 00:02:20,724
Awakened or not, you're still weak
and still no match for me.

42
00:02:21,016 --> 00:02:23,727
What do you think you can do to me
in my current state?

43
00:02:24,144 --> 00:02:26,730
You still can't lay a single finger on—

44
00:02:32,277 --> 00:02:33,403
<i>I couldn't see that!</i>

45
00:02:34,905 --> 00:02:36,865
A-Are you kidding me?!

46
00:02:36,948 --> 00:02:38,950
A puny chicken?

47
00:02:39,326 --> 00:02:42,954
Don't you dare...
underestimate me!

48
00:02:57,010 --> 00:02:58,929
Don't mess with me!

49
00:02:59,346 --> 00:03:05,394
There's no way I could lose to you,
a lowly Goshikidori!

50
00:03:05,727 --> 00:03:08,397
Die, die, die, die,
die, die, die, die!

51
00:03:08,480 --> 00:03:11,692
<i>We have to destroy
that sphere in his chest!</i>

52
00:03:12,234 --> 00:03:13,068
Hatsu!

53
00:03:15,487 --> 00:03:16,905
Bou! Ten!

54
00:03:17,280 --> 00:03:19,616
Ultra...
Explosive...

55
00:03:20,450 --> 00:03:22,661
Chicken Leg!

56
00:03:22,786 --> 00:03:26,456
Shatter!!

57
00:03:26,623 --> 00:03:28,375
<i>Damn!
It's too hard!</i>

58
00:03:33,630 --> 00:03:34,965
Bastards...

59
00:03:35,298 --> 00:03:38,051
I'm gonna turn you into
ground chicken!

60
00:03:41,972 --> 00:03:43,098
Take this!

61
00:03:44,641 --> 00:03:46,977
Die!!

62
00:03:47,477 --> 00:03:48,562
Super...

63
00:03:48,979 --> 00:03:55,402
Kokekokko!

64
00:03:58,321 --> 00:04:00,407
I was chosen!

65
00:04:00,991 --> 00:04:03,660
I can't lose to the likes of you!
No matter what!

66
00:04:03,743 --> 00:04:07,706
I won't lose!

67
00:04:10,500 --> 00:04:11,918
W-What?!

68
00:04:12,294 --> 00:04:14,795
That sphere isn't breaking!

69
00:04:14,796 --> 00:04:17,424
It's regenerating his body parts
before they're destroyed?!

70
00:04:17,966 --> 00:04:20,051
<i>Damn,
his life force is off the charts!</i>

71
00:04:21,011 --> 00:04:21,887
<i>Not good!</i>

72
00:04:22,387 --> 00:04:24,181
<i>He's losing power!</i>

73
00:04:24,598 --> 00:04:26,600
<i>Damn it, is he at his limit?</i>

74
00:04:27,100 --> 00:04:28,685
<i>No, that's not it!</i>

75
00:04:34,524 --> 00:04:36,568
<i>He's focusing all of his power
on one spot.</i>

76
00:04:36,777 --> 00:04:39,070
<i>He's putting everything into the
sphere!</i>

77
00:05:09,976 --> 00:05:12,479
It's over, Father.

78
00:05:15,023 --> 00:05:17,901
EPISODE 12: WHAT THE BIRDS, BEASTS,
AND TREES SHARE

79
00:05:35,001 --> 00:05:36,795
Are you okay, Brother?

80
00:05:39,631 --> 00:05:41,466
What, this? It's nothing.

81
00:05:42,551 --> 00:05:44,386
<i>That incredible energy...</i>

82
00:05:45,220 --> 00:05:47,013
<i>It was so dark and overwhelming.</i>

83
00:05:47,597 --> 00:05:50,350
<i>Once a Righteous Egg is awakened,
there's no going back.</i>

84
00:05:51,017 --> 00:05:53,061
<i>That awakening might
have been forbidden.</i>

85
00:05:53,687 --> 00:05:57,649
<i>It's possible that
he could lose his sanity,</i>

86
00:05:57,774 --> 00:06:00,861
<i>and his heart and mind might
get swallowed up in darkness...</i>

87
00:06:01,820 --> 00:06:04,364
<i>I won't let that happen!</i>

88
00:06:04,823 --> 00:06:06,658
Mister!

89
00:06:07,367 --> 00:06:09,160
Mister!

90
00:06:09,244 --> 00:06:11,830
I missed you!!

91
00:06:12,622 --> 00:06:14,749
Huh? You're badly hurt!

92
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:17,210
Are you okay, Mister?

93
00:06:17,252 --> 00:06:18,378
Y-Yeah...

94
00:06:18,587 --> 00:06:20,380
Oh, good!

95
00:06:20,630 --> 00:06:21,756
Guess what!

96
00:06:21,840 --> 00:06:23,842
I don't remember it too well,

97
00:06:23,967 --> 00:06:27,012
but I defeated the monster
inside of Morio's head!

98
00:06:27,178 --> 00:06:29,514
I gave it my all!

99
00:06:31,141 --> 00:06:33,602
Why aren't you praising me?

100
00:06:33,643 --> 00:06:36,688
By the way, where is Morio?

101
00:06:36,855 --> 00:06:37,856
Piyoko...

102
00:06:40,692 --> 00:06:43,778
Morio's... dead.

103
00:06:44,821 --> 00:06:45,822
What...?

104
00:06:50,702 --> 00:06:52,120
You're lying...

105
00:06:52,579 --> 00:06:54,748
That's impossible!

106
00:07:01,254 --> 00:07:02,339
Morio...

107
00:07:02,714 --> 00:07:05,050
But we just saved you!

108
00:07:05,675 --> 00:07:09,012
Why did you die?!

109
00:07:09,554 --> 00:07:11,681
No, Morio!!

110
00:07:11,765 --> 00:07:14,100
You can't die!

111
00:07:16,227 --> 00:07:18,229
Please come back!

112
00:07:19,606 --> 00:07:21,524
Morio––!!

113
00:07:21,608 --> 00:07:22,567
- I'm...
- Mori—!

114
00:07:23,902 --> 00:07:28,073
...alive

115
00:07:29,741 --> 00:07:32,744
Morio's a zombie!!!

116
00:07:33,203 --> 00:07:34,120
Morio?!

117
00:07:38,208 --> 00:07:39,125
Ow!

118
00:07:41,002 --> 00:07:43,880
Ow, ow, ow...

119
00:07:45,507 --> 00:07:46,508
Oh!

120
00:07:47,092 --> 00:07:50,845
I'm... alive!

121
00:07:51,971 --> 00:07:53,014
I'm...

122
00:07:53,848 --> 00:07:57,644
...alive!!

123
00:08:00,105 --> 00:08:02,982
M-Morio, is that really you?

124
00:08:03,108 --> 00:08:04,693
Oh, Keiji!!

125
00:08:04,776 --> 00:08:06,486
I don't really get it,

126
00:08:06,695 --> 00:08:08,988
but I just tried really hard
to stay alive...

127
00:08:09,072 --> 00:08:11,700
and I didn't die!

128
00:08:11,783 --> 00:08:16,329
I think my life force is
just pretty darn tough!

129
00:08:17,789 --> 00:08:20,667
You're so crazy, damn it...

130
00:08:20,750 --> 00:08:25,088
You're so amazing, Morio!
You're so amazing!

131
00:08:25,171 --> 00:08:27,549
Mo-ri-o! Mo-ri-o!

132
00:08:27,632 --> 00:08:29,259
M-M-Miss Elizabeth!

133
00:08:29,467 --> 00:08:30,969
H-How's Father––?!

134
00:08:31,136 --> 00:08:33,304
He's fine.
He's alive.

135
00:08:33,513 --> 00:08:35,181
I think he'll regain
consciousness soon.

136
00:08:35,515 --> 00:08:37,642
T-Thank you so much,
Miss Elizabeth!

137
00:08:38,017 --> 00:08:40,645
P-Please let me carry him.

138
00:08:43,022 --> 00:08:44,065
Father...

139
00:08:49,779 --> 00:08:51,531
We really won...

140
00:08:52,198 --> 00:08:53,867
Y-Yes...

141
00:08:54,659 --> 00:08:58,038
<i>To think that his awakening
could make him so powerful...</i>

142
00:09:00,331 --> 00:09:03,793
<i>For now, I'll keep my Brother's
awakening a secret...</i>

143
00:09:04,210 --> 00:09:05,920
Excuse me...

144
00:09:06,504 --> 00:09:11,176
With all this commotion, I believe
the police will be on their way.

145
00:09:11,718 --> 00:09:13,845
We should get out of here soon.

146
00:09:14,054 --> 00:09:15,638
Good point.

147
00:09:15,847 --> 00:09:16,848
Let's hurry!

148
00:09:16,890 --> 00:09:18,391
Y-Yes!

149
00:09:25,440 --> 00:09:26,274
Brother?

150
00:09:33,615 --> 00:09:35,700
Stubborn bastard!

151
00:09:35,742 --> 00:09:37,869
- This time around, I'll stop–!
- Brother, wait!

152
00:09:38,620 --> 00:09:40,080
Something's weird...

153
00:09:41,039 --> 00:09:42,791
I don't sense any murderous intent
from him.

154
00:09:44,209 --> 00:09:45,210
<i>Hikari...</i>

155
00:09:46,377 --> 00:09:47,420
<i>Hikari...</i>

156
00:09:48,797 --> 00:09:49,798
<i>Hikari...</i>

157
00:09:54,260 --> 00:09:55,345
<i>Hikari!</i>

158
00:10:00,058 --> 00:10:02,227
My precious Hikari...

159
00:10:03,228 --> 00:10:04,938
My precious treasure.

160
00:10:07,732 --> 00:10:08,733
I'm home!

161
00:10:08,858 --> 00:10:09,901
Welcome back!

162
00:10:10,401 --> 00:10:11,694
What are you doing?

163
00:10:11,778 --> 00:10:13,196
Sorting through this album.

164
00:10:13,321 --> 00:10:15,532
Wow, I haven't seen these before.

165
00:10:15,698 --> 00:10:17,408
There's multiples of the same pose...

166
00:10:17,575 --> 00:10:21,579
You were so cute I always had
to pull you close for pictures.

167
00:10:21,746 --> 00:10:24,207
That must be why I was
wiggling away in half of them.

168
00:10:24,582 --> 00:10:26,751
Back then, I was so anxious
being a single mom.

169
00:10:26,835 --> 00:10:31,256
Everyone disapproved,
but you grew up so well.

170
00:10:31,714 --> 00:10:33,174
I'm so grateful.

171
00:10:33,800 --> 00:10:38,721
Not having a father
must have been tough...

172
00:10:39,013 --> 00:10:40,014
I'm so sorry.

173
00:10:40,181 --> 00:10:44,102
I-It's fine!
I had you!

174
00:10:44,519 --> 00:10:46,187
Oh, look at the time!

175
00:10:46,229 --> 00:10:48,022
I'm gonna be late to
my cleaning job!

176
00:10:48,731 --> 00:10:49,983
I'm sorry, Hikari!

177
00:10:50,024 --> 00:10:52,235
Dinner's on the stove.

178
00:10:52,610 --> 00:10:55,280
Mom, you're going to
wear yourself out.

179
00:10:55,572 --> 00:10:57,407
Can't you just work
afternoon shifts?

180
00:11:02,328 --> 00:11:05,665
I want to make sure
you go to college,

181
00:11:05,790 --> 00:11:07,458
and mature into
a responsible adult.

182
00:11:08,042 --> 00:11:09,543
That's why I'm going to
give it my all,

183
00:11:09,544 --> 00:11:11,004
until I have enough
for your tuition.

184
00:11:11,838 --> 00:11:15,258
Okay. I'll study hard

185
00:11:15,675 --> 00:11:18,386
and make sure you don't have
to work so hard in the future.

186
00:11:21,806 --> 00:11:24,809
Hikari!! You're going to
make me cry!

187
00:11:24,893 --> 00:11:27,812
Stop it! Gross!

188
00:11:29,189 --> 00:11:30,690
Well, I'm headed out!

189
00:11:30,940 --> 00:11:32,275
Okay! See you later!

190
00:11:38,948 --> 00:11:40,366
Yes, this is the Yoshino residence.

191
00:11:40,867 --> 00:11:42,493
<i>This is the Akamori
Police Department.</i>

192
00:11:42,702 --> 00:11:45,663
<i>Kimiko Yoshino was involved in
a car accident and...</i>

193
00:11:45,830 --> 00:11:46,748
What?

194
00:11:47,582 --> 00:11:49,500
<i>Hello? Hello?</i>

195
00:12:18,988 --> 00:12:19,948
Mom...

196
00:12:20,865 --> 00:12:22,158
Mom...

197
00:12:26,704 --> 00:12:30,416
Mom!

198
00:12:34,754 --> 00:12:35,588
What?

199
00:12:37,632 --> 00:12:39,968
I'm dead...

200
00:12:41,928 --> 00:12:42,929
What's going on?

201
00:12:44,013 --> 00:12:45,181
What's happening to my body?

202
00:13:00,780 --> 00:13:01,906
<i>Where are the Goshikidori?!</i>

203
00:13:11,833 --> 00:13:13,209
<i>Don't come near me!</i>

204
00:13:16,004 --> 00:13:17,797
<i>I can't take it anymore!</i>

205
00:13:18,881 --> 00:13:19,757
<i>Hikari.</i>

206
00:13:20,925 --> 00:13:23,845
<i>It's okay now, Hikari.</i>

207
00:13:24,470 --> 00:13:26,848
<i>M-Mom...</i>

208
00:13:28,725 --> 00:13:29,809
<i>Mom...</i>

209
00:13:30,977 --> 00:13:33,396
<i>You don't need to suffer anymore.</i>

210
00:13:46,492 --> 00:13:48,286
Thank... you...

211
00:13:51,289 --> 00:13:54,417
Did he just say, "Thank you"?

212
00:13:54,500 --> 00:13:58,671
Was he under some
mind control until now?

213
00:14:00,298 --> 00:14:01,674
It's a police helicopter!

214
00:14:01,799 --> 00:14:03,009
Let's hurry!

215
00:14:03,926 --> 00:14:04,927
Morio?

216
00:14:05,678 --> 00:14:07,597
He's still alive.

217
00:14:07,805 --> 00:14:09,432
I don't think he's
a bad guy anymore.

218
00:14:09,640 --> 00:14:11,017
Let's bring him with us.

219
00:14:11,309 --> 00:14:12,894
Are you serious?!

220
00:14:12,977 --> 00:14:14,020
Hold on, Keiji.

221
00:14:14,228 --> 00:14:16,731
Maybe we can learn something
about the Devils.

222
00:14:17,106 --> 00:14:18,149
Let's take him with us.

223
00:14:19,525 --> 00:14:20,568
Do what you want!

224
00:14:23,821 --> 00:14:25,865
What a marvelous battle.

225
00:14:26,699 --> 00:14:31,662
I think your Righteous Egg...
still has some untapped potential.

226
00:14:32,830 --> 00:14:36,793
He will be pleased with this...

227
00:15:11,577 --> 00:15:12,703
Everyone, wake up!

228
00:15:12,745 --> 00:15:14,330
He's come to!

229
00:15:16,582 --> 00:15:17,750
Be careful!

230
00:15:17,875 --> 00:15:19,252
Are you okay?

231
00:15:21,212 --> 00:15:23,798
I-I did such terrible things
to you all...

232
00:15:25,466 --> 00:15:27,844
I'm... truly sorry!

233
00:15:29,720 --> 00:15:32,098
But you were
brainwashed too, right?

234
00:15:32,473 --> 00:15:33,724
Who did this to you?

235
00:15:37,728 --> 00:15:39,147
A woman named Kugone.

236
00:15:40,523 --> 00:15:42,692
W-Who are you?

237
00:15:50,199 --> 00:15:51,742
I knew it.
This child...

238
00:15:52,535 --> 00:15:54,287
is a compatible candidate.

239
00:15:56,497 --> 00:15:57,790
Mom...

240
00:15:58,875 --> 00:16:00,042
It's me...

241
00:16:00,543 --> 00:16:01,586
Hikari...

242
00:16:02,420 --> 00:16:06,632
I'll make you happy, okay?

243
00:16:07,258 --> 00:16:10,469
His love was so powerful,
he became a Demon...

244
00:16:12,638 --> 00:16:16,309
He won't let go of
those thoughts easily.

245
00:16:17,852 --> 00:16:21,063
I won't be able to
control your body...

246
00:16:22,231 --> 00:16:24,400
I'll have to take over
your heart instead.

247
00:16:29,822 --> 00:16:32,783
I'll be your Mama now.

248
00:16:33,951 --> 00:16:38,080
You're not... my mom!

249
00:16:41,876 --> 00:16:44,253
Until you let go of your love
for your mother,

250
00:16:44,295 --> 00:16:46,339
the pain will continue.

251
00:16:46,797 --> 00:16:49,008
We have plenty of time.

252
00:16:50,885 --> 00:16:54,180
<i>The torture lasted over a month.</i>

253
00:16:55,306 --> 00:16:56,307
<i>And then...</i>

254
00:16:57,642 --> 00:16:59,727
How are you feeling today, Hikari?

255
00:17:00,811 --> 00:17:03,397
I feel great, Mama.

256
00:17:04,815 --> 00:17:06,776
My precious Hikari...

257
00:17:07,026 --> 00:17:09,153
There isn't another family
that exists

258
00:17:09,237 --> 00:17:11,447
with a bond as deep as ours...

259
00:17:11,989 --> 00:17:13,991
I know, Mama...

260
00:17:14,617 --> 00:17:17,328
A true bond, right?

261
00:17:17,912 --> 00:17:20,456
I love you, Hikari.

262
00:17:20,748 --> 00:17:23,334
I love you, Mama.

263
00:17:24,794 --> 00:17:27,046
She's too cruel!

264
00:17:27,672 --> 00:17:28,506
She's true evil!

265
00:17:28,923 --> 00:17:30,299
It's unforgiveable!

266
00:17:31,884 --> 00:17:34,804
Kugone must be creating more Devils
all across the country.

267
00:17:34,887 --> 00:17:37,348
All to take over the world?

268
00:17:37,682 --> 00:17:41,143
Yes. And the Goshikidori family
is in the way.

269
00:17:42,103 --> 00:17:42,937
And...

270
00:17:43,062 --> 00:17:46,649
Kugone is most likely after
your Righteous Egg.

271
00:17:46,899 --> 00:17:48,401
My Righteous Egg?

272
00:17:48,693 --> 00:17:50,778
I was told to keep you alive.

273
00:17:50,987 --> 00:17:52,321
<i>I see...</i>

274
00:17:52,822 --> 00:17:55,575
<i>So that was the Righteous Egg,
after all.</i>

275
00:17:56,158 --> 00:17:57,910
Is that Kugone the boss?

276
00:17:58,786 --> 00:18:02,456
Kugone is...
the second-in-command.

277
00:18:04,041 --> 00:18:05,293
Master Gakuma...

278
00:18:05,960 --> 00:18:09,839
That child... Keiji's Awakening
of Ruin has finally occurred.

279
00:18:12,883 --> 00:18:13,884
I see.

280
00:18:15,428 --> 00:18:18,139
Very well, it's almost time then.

281
00:18:19,223 --> 00:18:21,767
Yes, just as you said.

282
00:18:24,478 --> 00:18:26,564
What will you all do now?

283
00:18:27,607 --> 00:18:28,608
I...

284
00:18:29,191 --> 00:18:31,444
completely destroyed that town.

285
00:18:32,320 --> 00:18:35,990
Seems there are still a few Demons
under my control.

286
00:18:36,574 --> 00:18:38,618
So, we're going to help
rebuild the town.

287
00:18:39,035 --> 00:18:40,995
H-Help?

288
00:18:41,287 --> 00:18:44,790
It's true there were no casualties,
but the townspeople are very angry.

289
00:18:45,333 --> 00:18:47,752
But you were brainwashed,
after all...

290
00:18:48,544 --> 00:18:51,881
Still, I need to take
responsibility for what I did.

291
00:18:53,007 --> 00:18:55,051
Whatever happens,
I'll atone for everything.

292
00:18:56,469 --> 00:18:58,763
Huh? Morio's not here!

293
00:18:59,013 --> 00:19:02,266
He said saying goodbye to everyone
was too painful,

294
00:19:02,433 --> 00:19:03,768
so he went off a little bit ago.

295
00:19:03,809 --> 00:19:04,685
Huh?!

296
00:19:05,770 --> 00:19:08,648
You're the worst, Morio!

297
00:19:08,731 --> 00:19:11,651
You didn't give me a chance
to say goodbye to you!

298
00:19:13,569 --> 00:19:14,862
<i>That sounds like him.</i>

299
00:19:15,613 --> 00:19:18,491
Well, I'm sure we'll bump into him
again somewhere.

300
00:19:18,574 --> 00:19:20,660
Next time I see him,
I'm gonna beat him up!

301
00:19:21,243 --> 00:19:23,454
Take care, everyone.

302
00:19:23,579 --> 00:19:24,997
Yes, you too.

303
00:19:25,456 --> 00:19:26,623
Be well!

304
00:19:26,624 --> 00:19:28,584
Bye-bye!

305
00:19:37,760 --> 00:19:43,557
Keiji... Little Chick...
Everyone!

306
00:19:50,189 --> 00:19:51,147
Brother...

307
00:19:51,148 --> 00:19:54,276
It seems like we were after
the same enemy.

308
00:19:54,527 --> 00:19:55,569
Yeah...

309
00:19:55,986 --> 00:19:58,239
<i>So who's this big boss?</i>

310
00:19:58,614 --> 00:20:01,492
<i>He usually stays in his human form.</i>

311
00:20:01,784 --> 00:20:04,203
<i>But when he transforms
into his Demon form...</i>

312
00:20:05,037 --> 00:20:07,665
<i>He's more powerful
than all of you put together.</i>

313
00:20:07,915 --> 00:20:09,583
<i>Where is he now?</i>

314
00:20:09,750 --> 00:20:11,711
<i>I don't know, but...</i>

315
00:20:12,253 --> 00:20:15,214
<i>He did appear out in public once.</i>

316
00:20:15,715 --> 00:20:17,550
<i>There should be footage of him
floating around.</i>

317
00:20:17,758 --> 00:20:19,719
<i>W-What's his name?</i>

318
00:20:20,261 --> 00:20:21,637
<i>The world knows him as...</i>

319
00:20:22,847 --> 00:20:23,806
<i>The White Demon.</i>

320
00:20:24,473 --> 00:20:25,683
<i>That's what they call him.</i>

321
00:20:28,686 --> 00:20:29,979
<i>The White Demon...</i>

322
00:20:30,646 --> 00:20:34,316
<i>It seems our paths
are deeply intertwined...</i>

323
00:20:35,693 --> 00:20:39,113
Wow! It's a great, big pool!!

324
00:20:43,826 --> 00:20:46,287
<i>Wait for me, Sarah.</i>

325
00:20:47,204 --> 00:20:49,582
<i>Even that brat
was able to come back.</i>

326
00:20:51,292 --> 00:20:54,378
<i>Sarah, I promise
I'm gonna get you back!</i>

327
00:21:08,684 --> 00:21:12,730
Kokekokko!

328
00:23:51,221 --> 00:23:53,766
THE END

329
00:24:04,860 --> 00:24:09,782
FAN ART CONTEST AWARDS

